Of the in-scene NPCs, assign `motivation`, `fear`, and `leverage` to **all present NPCs who play a narrative role** — anyone with dialogue, agency, or tension-creating behavior gets all three fields populated (motivation = what they fundamentally want; fear = what they dread most; leverage = what they can offer/threaten/withhold). Background extras standing silently at the edge of the scene may omit them.

